                [ 'p', 'Choosing a school laser requires a risk assessment and a review of the exact model and accessory manuals and the institution’s rules. Safety features and extraction do not replace training or access controls. Below are example machines and questions to ask before buying.' ],
                [ 'p', 'This guide is for teachers, school leaders, vocational colleges and makerspaces choosing a laser for the school workshop.' ],
                [ 'h2', 'What can students learn and make with a laser?' ],
